<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13495] ZookeeperDiscoverySpiMBeanImpl#getCoordinator can return invalid node as coordinator</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13495</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Due to invalid algorithm in &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.ignite.spi.discovery.zk.internal.ZookeeperDiscoveryImpl#getCoordinator&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
sometimes invalid coordinator could be returned&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Consider scenarion:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Start server #1&lt;br/&gt;
2. Start client&lt;br/&gt;
3. Start server #2&lt;br/&gt;
4. Stop server #1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After this, &lt;tt&gt;ZookeeperDiscoverySpiMBeanImpl#getCoordinator&lt;/tt&gt; returns as coordinator a client, because it is the oldest node in topology.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should fix &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.ignite.spi.discovery.zk.internal.ZookeeperDiscoveryImpl#getCoordinator&lt;/tt&gt; to return &lt;b&gt;oldest server&lt;/b&gt;, not any node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
